 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The adjectives",
   "texto": [
    "The adjective matches the name. The feminine is often formed by adding **-e**. In pairs such as **grand/grande** and **petit/petite**, the silent final consonant of the masculine is heard by adding it: **grand** («gra(n)») → **grande** («gra(n)d»), **petit** («pe-tí») → **petite** («pe-tít»).",
    "**Jeune** and **drôle**, which are already finished in **-e**, have the same shape in masculine and feminine. **Sympa** is also invariable in gender, although it ends in **-a**.",
    "In many adjectives **-s** is added in plural, usually mute: **long → longs**.",
    "To describe: **Il est grand** (is high), **Elle a les cheveux longs** (has long hair)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "From 20 to 69",
   "texto": [
    "The tens: **vingt** (20), **trente** (30), **quarante** (40), **cinquante** (50), **soixante** (60).",
    "The units are added with script: **vingt-deux**, **trente-cinq**, **soixante-neuf** (69). The one is **et un**: **vingt et un** (21), **trente et un** (31)."
   ]
  },
